 ## SSE 实时日志协议
 
 ```http
-GET /api/logs/{logId}/stream?last_seq={seq}
+GET /api/logs/{log_id}/stream?last_seq={seq}
 Headers: Accept: text/event-stream, Last-Event-ID: {seq}
 ```
 
 事件格式：
+
+```text
+id: 123
+event: chunk
+data: {"text":"...","seq":123}
 ```
-id: {seq}
-event: log
-data: {"level":"INFO","text":"...","ts":"2026-10-26T08:00:01+08:00"}
+
+心跳是 SSE 注释帧（不是 `ping` 事件）：
+
+```text
+: keep-alive
+
